@VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Every vehicle make
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes
Accept: application/json

### Vehicle types for a known make (448 = Toyota)
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/448/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

### Unknown make - expect 200 with an empty array, not a 404
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/999999/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

### Malformed id - expect 404 from the route constraint, no handler involved
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/abc/vehicle-types
Accept: application/json

### Models for a make and year (474 = Honda)
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/474/models?year=2015
Accept: application/json

### Same, narrowed to cars - motorcycles such as CB1100 should drop out
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/474/models?year=2015&vehicleType=car
Accept: application/json

### Implausible year - expect 200 with an empty array, mirroring vPIC
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/474/models?year=1900
Accept: application/json

### Missing year - expect 400 from model binding
GET {{VehicleExplorer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/makes/474/models
Accept: application/json

###
